                        <strong>Expression Atlas R Package on Bioconductor</strong><br>
                        Search and download pre-packaged data from Expression Atlas inside an R session. Raw counts are
                        provided for RNA-seq datasets and normalized intensities are available for microarray
                        experiments. Protocols describing how the data was generated and sample annotations are
                        contained within the downloaded R objects.
                    </p>
